cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Speech Emotion Recognition via Transfer Learning"
abstract: >
  An open-source comparison of text-only (RoBERTa), audio-only (wav2vec2 / WavLM),
  and multimodal cross-attention transfer learning approaches for Speech Emotion
  Recognition on RAVDESS and MELD. Establishes English baselines as the foundation
  for an active research programme on cross-lingual SER for low-resource South
  Asian languages (Urdu, Hindi, Punjabi). Implemented with PyTorch Lightning and
  HuggingFace Transformers, with a live Gradio demo on HuggingFace Spaces.
